{
  "id": "parity-sites.v1",
  "frozenOn": "2026-09-29",
  "firecrawlSnapshot": "firecrawl-js 4.42.0",
  "purpose": "Real-site checks for the P1 items in ROADMAP.md. Batch L is the audit's first live batch (real-site-test-set.md, in its order), the 'first 12 real-site URLs' of the P1 exit. Batch 1 holds P1 defect checks written before that list was committed: practice sites first, where any failure is a W2L bug, and the blocking site last. Batch api covers the P1 items that are API behaviour rather than page content. Each check names the P1 item it accepts ('FS' = no false success in general), or the audit's feature id (feature-matrix.csv) where no P1 item fits; each batch L case names its main feature.",
  "rules": [
    "Cases and URLs are not replaced or dropped after freezing; a site that changes or disappears stays in the record with its result.",
    "A check encodes the correct result, not the current one. A case passes when every check passes.",
    "S10 and L06 need direct network access to wikipedia.org. On a network that only reaches it through an HTTP proxy, W2L cannot reach it today (no proxy support), and the record says so.",
    "Batch L values that a site updates on a schedule (statistics releases, data updates, report years) are checked by pattern or minimum; the case note gives the values seen on 2026-09-29."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "batch": 1,
      "url": "https://books.toscrape.com/",
      "request": { "formats": ["markdown", "links"] },
      "checks": [
        { "item": "FS", "type": "field", "path": "status", "equals": "success" },
        { "item": "3", "type": "markdownMatches", "pattern": "Warning!(\\*\\*)? This is a demo website" },
        { "item": "3", "type": "markdownExcludes", "text": "** **" },
        { "item": "3", "type": "markdownIncludes", "text": "£51.77" },
        { "item": "4", "type": "linksAbsolute" },
        { "item": "4", "type": "linksInclude", "url": "https://books.toscrape.com/catalogue/a-light-in-the-attic_1000/index.html" },
        { "item": "4", "type": "markdownLinksAbsolute" }
      ]
    },
    {
